of the package. This makes the package version number higher than the one p=
rovided by Debian, so that the package will easily install as an update to =
the original package. Such a change is best effected with the <code class=
=3D"command">dch</code> command (<span class=3D"emphasis"><em>Debian CHange=
log</em></span>) from the <span class=3D"pkg pkg">devscripts</span> package=
