bout how to change the default behavior. With packages using <code class=3D=
"command">dh</code>, you might need to add an override for the <code class=
=3D"command">dh_auto_configure</code> or <code class=3D"command">dh_auto_bu=
ild</code> commands (see their respective manual pages and <span class=3D"c=
