source package's <code class=3D"filename">.dsc</code> (<code class=3D"liter=
al">-us</code>) nor the produced <code class=3D"filename">.changes</code> f=
ile (<code class=3D"literal">-uc</code>) get signed with the package builde=
r's cryptographic key after the asuccessful build.
